5,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I worry about the long-term viability of any new program we select today.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need to know if previous initiatives actually worked before spending more.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,I am concerned about how the workload will be distributed among our staff.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I am worried if the new program will fit into our current daily schedule.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I have seen many good ideas fail in the second year, so I am cautious.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"Agreed. We must look at the financial reality, not just the promise.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Midori, do you think the current staffing levels can support another major change?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shion, that is exactly my fear. The rosters are already stretched thin.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Shizue, I agree. If the booking system crashes, we are in trouble.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, yes. I want to see what the records actually say about past failures.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the ledger to see what is truly available.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shion,,I will check the readmission figures to see if the trial helped anyone.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I will review the staffing records to see where the pressure is highest.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will check the booking system and the physical room availability.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the board minutes and the data agreements with outside surgeries.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,Let us see what the numbers say before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shion,,Silence is often the loudest indicator of a failed project.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope we can find a balance that does not burn out the team.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I just want to make sure the doors don't jam when we open them.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will keep a gentle eye on the details that others might overlook.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
